{"id":"ec2932ad627d4692","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-segment.md","title":"Segment","display":"df-segment — Segment","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-segment","aliases":["58-df-segment"],"display":"df-segment — Segment","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-real-closed.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-segment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-segment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-segment — Segment"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"00787d1ad50fa75c\" href=\"?note=00787d1ad50fa75c\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-real-closed.md\">../batch15/58-df-real-closed.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,x,y,V,k,+_V,\\odot,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,&lt;_{k}\\in V\">\\(S,x,y,V,k,+_V,\\odot,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,&lt;_{k}\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\\)</span> is the explicit vector-space predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderedField}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderedField}_S\\)</span> is the ordered-field predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"00787d1ad50fa75c\" href=\"?note=00787d1ad50fa75c\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-real-closed.md\">../batch15/58-df-real-closed.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Segment}_S:V^{12}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Segment}_S:V^{12}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}segment}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Segment}_S(S,x,y,V,k,+_V,\\odot,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,&lt;_{k})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{OrderedField}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,&lt;_{k})\n\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,k,+_V,\\odot,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land x,y\\in V\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land S=\\Bigl\\{z\\in V:\\exists t,a\\in k\\;\\bigl(\n(t=0_k\\lor0_k&lt;_{k}t)\n\\land(t=1_k\\lor t&lt;_{k}1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}{}\\land +_k(\\langle a,t\\rangle)=1_k\n\\land z=+_V(\\langle\\odot(\\langle a,x\\rangle),\\odot(\\langle t,y\\rangle)\\rangle)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}segment}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Segment}_S(S,x,y,V,k,+_V,\\odot,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,&lt;_{k})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{OrderedField}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,&lt;_{k})\n\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,k,+_V,\\odot,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land x,y\\in V\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land S=\\Bigl\\{z\\in V:\\exists t,a\\in k\\;\\bigl(\n(t=0_k\\lor0_k&lt;_{k}t)\n\\land(t=1_k\\lor t&lt;_{k}1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}{}\\land +_k(\\langle a,t\\rangle)=1_k\n\\land z=+_V(\\langle\\odot(\\langle a,x\\rangle),\\odot(\\langle t,y\\rangle)\\rangle)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every operation and the order relation used by the affine combination is now an explicit argument.</li>\n<li>The equation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_k(\\langle a,t\\rangle)=1_k\">\\(+_k(\\langle a,t\\rangle)=1_k\\)</span> expresses <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=1_k-t\">\\(a=1_k-t\\)</span> without introducing a hidden subtraction operation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-real-closed.md","status":"resolved","id":"00787d1ad50fa75c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-real-closed.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S$ is the explicit vector-space predicate from [[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-real-closed.md","status":"resolved","id":"00787d1ad50fa75c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OrderedField}_S$ is the ordered-field predicate from [[../batch15/58-df-real-closed.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,x,y,V,k,+_V,\\odot,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,<_{k}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrderedField}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Segment}_S:V^{12}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}segment}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{Segment}_S(S,x,y,V,k,+_V,\\odot,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,<_{k})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{OrderedField}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,<_{k})\n\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,k,+_V,\\odot,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land x,y\\in V\\\\\n&{}\\land S=\\Bigl\\{z\\in V:\\exists t,a\\in k\\;\\bigl(\n(t=0_k\\lor0_k<_{k}t)\n\\land(t=1_k\\lor t<_{k}1_k)\\\\\n&\\hspace{13em}{}\\land +_k(\\langle a,t\\rangle)=1_k\n\\land z=+_V(\\langle\\odot(\\langle a,x\\rangle),\\odot(\\langle t,y\\rangle)\\rangle)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"+_k(\\langle a,t\\rangle)=1_k","display":false},{"tex":"a=1_k-t","display":false}],"bytes":1382,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1122","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-segment.md|58-df-segment]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["592f9cfb66a507c2","00787d1ad50fa75c"]}